<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Logout — License Manager</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { --bg:#0f1723; --surface:#1a2332; --border:#2a3441; --text:#e2e8f0; --muted:#94a3b8; --primary:#6366f1; --radius:10px; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0; }
    body { background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px; }
    .card { background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px;width:100%;max-width:380px;text-align:center; }
    .card .icon { font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:14px; }
    .card h1 { font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px; }
    .card p { color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:22px; }
    .btn { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:7px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:all .15s;font-family:inherit; }
    .btn-danger { background:#7f1d1d;color:#fca5a5;width:100%; }
    .btn-danger:hover { background:#991b1b; }
    .btn-outline { background:transparent;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border);width:100%;margin-top:10px;text-decoration:none; }
    .btn-outline:hover { background:var(--border);color:var(--text); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="icon">👋</div>
  <h1>Đăng xuất</h1>
  <p>Bạn có chắc muốn đăng xuất khỏi License Manager?</p>

  <form method="POST" action="/logout">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">🚪 Đăng xuất</button>
  </form>
  <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">← Quay lại Dashboard</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
